{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-201880-r4523798","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:BBQ Pork Fried Rice","sourcePageId":201880,"sourceRevision":"4523798","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-07-15T05:20:25Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:BBQ%20Pork%20Fried%20Rice&oldid=4523798","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:24:40.533Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Barbecue recipes","Category:Chinese recipes","Category:Inexpensive recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for fried rice","Category:Recipes using cabbage","Category:Recipes using cucumber","Category:Recipes using dehydrated broth","Category:Recipes using egg","Category:Recipes using fresh ginger","Category:Recipes using green onion","Category:Recipes using hoisin sauce","Category:Recipes using jalapeño chile","Category:Recipes using lettuce","Category:Recipes using pork","Category:Recipes using sugar","Category:Recipes with metric units"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"a6cfcb1649d91ac39ab33661ed6594fa2ac090249cbc1b5f367738dcc6ec48da","sourceWikitext":"__NOTOC__\n{{Recipesummary|category=Rice recipes|servings=4|time=1 hour|difficulty=3| Energy = 360 kcal}}\n\n{{Recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Cuisine of China|Cuisine of China]]\n\n==Ingredients==\n\n=== Pork ===\n* 1 piece (750 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]]) boneless [[Cookbook:Pork#Loin|pork loin]], cut into 30 pieces\n\n* 50 [[Cookbook:Milliliter|ml]] [[Cookbook:Barbecue Sauce|barbeque sauce]]\n* 15 ml light [[Cookbook:Soy sauce|soy sauce]]\n* 30 ml [[Cookbook:Hoisin Sauce|hoisin sauce]]\n* 5 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Sugar|sugar]]\n* 2½ tbsp [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n\n=== Fried rice ===\n* 6½ [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Olive Oil|olive oil]]\n* 5 tbsp [[Cookbook:Sesame Oil|sesame oil]]\n* 7 cloves [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]], [[Cookbook:Mincing|minced]]\n* 5 [[Cookbook:Centimetre (cm)|cm]] piece of [[Cookbook:Ginger|ginger]], minced\n* 5 red [[Cookbook:Chilli|chillies]], minced\n* 6 [[Cookbook:Scallion|scallion]], cut into 2 cm pieces\n* 4 [[Cookbook:Egg|eggs]], mixed\n* 1000 g cooked [[Cookbook:Rice|rice]]\n* 4 tbsp salted [[Cookbook:Soy sauce|soy sauce]]\n* 2 tbsp chicken [[Cookbook:Dehydrated Broth|bouillon powder]]\n* 1½ tbsp [[Cookbook:Oyster sauce|oyster sauce]]\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* 20 g [[Cookbook:Jalapeño|jalapeño]]\n\n=== Garnish ===\n* Shredded [[Cookbook:Cabbage|cabbage]]\n* [[Cookbook:Tomato|Tomato]]\n* [[Cookbook:Pickle|Pickles]]\n* Shredded [[Cookbook:Lettuce|lettuce]]\n* [[Cookbook:Cucumber|Cucumber]]\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Egg|eggs]], cooked into an [[Cookbook:Omelette|omelette]] and sliced 1 cm thick (as garnish)\n\n==Procedure==\n\n=== '''Pork''' ===\n# Combine the barbecue sauce, soy sauce, hoisin sauce, sugar, and salt to make the marinade.\n# Place the pork into the sauce mixture. Cover with plastic wrap, and refrigerate for 25 minutes. Make sure the sauce in the bowl is really absorbed.\n# Transfer the pork to a baking pan, and [[Cookbook:Baking|bake]] for 20 minutes at {{#invoke:temperature|c|200}}. When finished, put the pork onto a plate.\n\n=== '''Fried rice''' ===\n# Heat the olive oil and sesame oil in a medium [[Cookbook:Wok|wok]]. Fry the garlic, red chillies, ginger and scallion, then stir briefly for 1 minute. Add the mixed egg and rice.\n# Add the grilled pork, salted soy sauce, chicken powder, oyster sauce, salt and jalapeño. Stir until mixed.\n# Serve hot with garnishes. \n\n[[Category:Recipes for fried rice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pork]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Chinese recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Inexpensive recipes]]\n[[Category:Barbecue recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cabbage]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cucumber]]\n[[Category:Recipes using dehydrated broth]]\n[[Category:Recipes using fresh ginger]]\n[[Category:Recipes using green onion]]\n[[Category:Recipes using hoisin sauce]]\n[[Category:Recipes using jalapeño chile]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lettuce]]","isRecipe":false,"recipe":{"name":"BBQ Pork Fried Rice","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[],"steps":[],"nutrition":null,"gaps":["Research extraction only; no culinary/editorial review.","Ingredient quantities, units, alternatives, food identities, aggregate duration, and nutrition remain unknown until individually parsed/reviewed.","Source-level CC BY-SA policy applies generally; page-specific exceptions have not been checked."]}},"parsedRecipe":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"wikibooks:201880","recordId":"wikibooks-201880-r4523798","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceRevision":"4523798","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:BBQ%20Pork%20Fried%20Rice&oldid=4523798","sourceSha256":"a6cfcb1649d91ac39ab33661ed6594fa2ac090249cbc1b5f367738dcc6ec48da","parserVersion":"wikibooks-sections-v3","quantityParserVersion":"source-prefix-v2","license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyright